Task: Add tapir dependencies + purerest.docs helper (Phase 1)

Summary: Added tapir-core/tapir-json-circe/tapir-http4s-server/tapir-openapi-docs/tapir-swagger-ui-bundle
(v1.11.25) to purerest's dependencies, and a new purerest.docs.Docs.routes helper that interprets a
List[ServerEndpoint[Any, F]] into an HttpRoutes[F] serving the endpoints themselves plus a mounted
Swagger UI and generated OpenAPI yaml (via tapir's SwaggerInterpreter + Http4sServerInterpreter).

Why: Foundation for converting InventoryRoutes/OrderRoutes to tapir in later phases, so routes and
API docs are generated from one source of truth instead of drifting apart.

Files:
- build.sbt (tapir dependencies)
- modules/purerest/src/main/scala/purerest/docs/Docs.scala (new)
- modules/purerest/src/test/scala/purerest/docs/DocsSuite.scala (new, TDD red->green)
